    "18-19: QA_ADMIT shows Sending in local pending area during injected15s pre-admission wait, then one canonical user bubble and response.",
    "20-22: injected uncommitted error is surfaced conservatively as Delivery not confirmed through native IPC; error details and Check delivery are available. Absence from current canonical read is not presented as proof of non-delivery.",
    "23: Add back to draft, replace text with Recovered local input, then send. New input completes once; original uncertain recovery copy remains until explicit dismissal."
